    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέω</span> B)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is spun, thread,
				yarn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1433
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				282e
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.98
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.143
			</span></i>; <i>thread of</i> a spider's <i>web,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				777
			</span></i>; of the Fates, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μοιράων νῆμ᾽ ἄλλυτον</span>”
