				Luc.
				<u>Philops.</u>
				25
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήματα σηρικά</span> silk
				<i>sutures,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.942
			</span></i>.</div>
